From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 04:29:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 12/13] cli: change live primary runtime and shadow sampling

Add an authenticated runtime-mode command for durable query and mutation policy updates on supporting self-hosted backends. Preserve omitted settings with revision-checked updates, retain independent route quarantines, and report fixed preparation failure reasons without exposing loader diagnostics.

Register the command in the release entry point and cover command selection and rejected preparation responses.
